  "notes": [
    "Model assets are external, immutable public HF downloads; manifest paths can be relocated while preserving URI and SHA-256.",
    "Native preservation config, voice SHA-256 and calibration heads are frozen under baseline/.",
    "Voice cache stored once; prefill.cache tensors contain only the suffix beginning at prefill_cache_start.",
    "Raw PCM and output fade tensors are separate. Continuation contains real upstream prefill and decoder state, using bounded four-frame traces; it does not claim EOS-limited stream parity.",
    "Target Rust continuation parity is staged for the continuation implementation task.",
    "determinism.json covers two complete pre-preservation generator runs; baseline manifest hashes later gain frozen Rust config and preservation identities.",
    "Boolean decoder-state flags are stored as uint8 for Candle; each model manifest retains their logical bool dtype names.",
    "Target 2m continuation replays 16 forced frames and warms the decoder with the final 12; other models retain four-frame traces.",
    "When regenerating baseline model tensors, retain the committed rust-config.yaml snapshot and fixture_config_path; the native preservation capture command records independent PCM and event order. Recompute manifest file hashes after intentionally replacing goldens."
